	(text "CH32V003F4P6: PA2 = VIN-SENSE (A0), PA1 = DOCK-SENSE (A1), PD2 = PROBE-SENSE (A3),\nPD3 = I-SENSE (A4), PC1 = CHARGE-EN (high = VDOCK-20V on), PC2 = PROBE-DRV,\nPC3/PC4 = IR-L/IR-R (TIM1_CH3/CH4, 38 kHz), PC0 = status LED, PD4 unused,\nPD5/PD6 = UART, PD1 = SWIO. HSI clock, no crystal.\nADC reference is VDD, and PROBE-DRV high is VDD too, so the probe math is ratiometric."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 152.654 164.846 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "903ec630-8fcc-4fd0-93ca-5603cf04db9e")
	)
	(text "OOMWOO charging-only dock, v2 (2026-10-27)\n20 V brick in; VDOCK-20V / DOCK- spring contacts out (energized only after the robot\nis recognised by its ~130k / ~30 uF signature); 38 kHz NEC IR beacon.\nCH32V003 control (Arduino core, ch32fun, PlatformIO). Refs in the 1000s: each board has its\nown range (main board 1-999, dock 1000s, sensor boards 2000s-7000s)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 40.64 40.64 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "c121ee0d-a62d-48df-96d0-aaa0927c9d8f")
	)
